  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>n</mi></math> be a positive integer and a complex number with unit modulus is a solution of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> can be",
    "image": null
  },
