  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> satisfies <math><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>Z</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> also satisfies <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> also satisfies <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,<br />we get,&nbsp;<math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup></math> must be the point of intersection of<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> {where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math> is non-real cube root of unity}<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> can be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is of the form of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
